{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42455","headline":"山中夏日 · 孟贯","name":"山中夏日","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"深山宜避暑，门户映岚光。\n夏木荫溪路，昼云埋石牀。\n心源澄道静，衣葛蘸泉凉。\n算得红尘里，谁知此兴长。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟贯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42455.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42455","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}